<title>SPAIN: Spain one-year bill yields fall sharply to 5.347 %.</title>
<headline>Spain one-year bill yields fall sharply to 5.347 %.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE    Yield    Pvs	 Price Pvs    Bid	Allocated</p>
<p> 1-year  5.347   5.590    94.87   94.65  649.30    567.22</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
